      "prompt": "<strong>[Easy] Isolating Success Paths with the else Clause</strong><p>Given <code>tokens = ['123', 'abc', '456', 'xyz', '789']</code>: Initialize <code>valid_nums = []</code>, <code>valid_count = 0</code>, and <code>error_count = 0</code>. In <code>try</code>, parse <code>num = int(t)</code>. Put downstream logic (appending to <code>valid_nums</code> and incrementing <code>valid_count</code>) in the <code>else:</code> block. In <code>except ValueError:</code> increment <code>error_count</code>.</p>",
