      "prompt": "<strong>[Hard] Custom Context Manager with __exit__ Suppression</strong><p>Implement <code>SafeAccount</code> with <code>__enter__</code> and <code>__exit__</code>. In <code>__exit__</code>, if <code>exc_type is ValueError</code>, append <code>'tx_rolled_back'</code> to <code>self.log</code> and return <code>True</code> (suppressing the error). Otherwise, append <code>'tx_committed'</code>. In a <code>with SafeAccount(500) as acc:</code> block, raise <code>ValueError('Insufficient funds')</code>. Store <code>acc.bal</code> in <code>final_balance</code> and <code>acc.log</code> in <code>transaction_log</code>.</p>",
