      "prompt": "<strong>[Hard] Programmatic Traceback Stack Extraction</strong><p>Using <code>sys</code> and <code>traceback</code>: Nest three functions (<code>stage_one -> stage_two -> stage_three</code>). In <code>stage_three</code>, raise <code>ZeroDivisionError('Divide by zero in pipeline')</code>. Catch it at the root. Use <code>traceback.extract_tb(sys.exc_info()[2])</code> to extract the function names <code>[f.name for f in frames]</code> into <code>stack_frames</code>, and <code>str(sys.exc_info()[1])</code> into <code>terminal_error</code>.</p>",
